{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\032.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Example 6:", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[108, 117], [304, 113], [305, 161], [108, 164]]}, {"text": "Which is greater; -10 or 3?", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[106, 183], [549, 173], [550, 216], [107, 226]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.876, "box": [[108, 246], [269, 246], [269, 283], [108, 283]]}, {"text": "On the number line, -10 lies to the left of 3. So, 3 is greater than -10.", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[102, 305], [1273, 270], [1274, 322], [104, 357]]}, {"text": "Symbolically 3>-10.", "conf": 0.893, "box": [[107, 372], [433, 364], [434, 407], [108, 415]]}, {"text": "Example 7:", "conf": 0.864, "box": [[104, 436], [298, 430], [299, 474], [106, 480]]}, {"text": "Whichissmaller;-9or-8?", "conf": 0.887, "box": [[105, 496], [546, 487], [547, 526], [105, 535]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.873, "box": [[106, 558], [265, 556], [266, 593], [106, 595]]}, {"text": "On the number line, -9 lies to the left of -8. So, -8 is greater than -9.", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[103, 618], [1271, 588], [1272, 634], [104, 664]]}, {"text": "Symbolically -8 > -9.", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[104, 682], [462, 672], [463, 715], [105, 725]]}, {"text": "Example 8:", "conf": 0.877, "box": [[106, 765], [296, 761], [297, 805], [107, 809]]}, {"text": "Which one is the smallest and which one is the greatest among 2, -5 and -1?", "conf": 0.94, "box": [[101, 831], [1418, 805], [1419, 857], [102, 883]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[104, 902], [261, 899], [262, 941], [104, 943]]}, {"text": "On the number line, 2 lies to the right of both -1 and -5. So 2 is the greatest. Similarly,-1", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[106, 970], [1623, 949], [1623, 992], [106, 1013]]}, {"text": "lies to the right of -5. So -5 is smaller than -1. So, 2 is the greatest and -5 is the smallest", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[104, 1038], [1613, 1019], [1613, 1064], [104, 1084]]}, {"text": "among these integers.", "conf": 0.899, "box": [[102, 1110], [466, 1107], [467, 1147], [102, 1150]]}, {"text": "Symbolically -5 < -1 < 2.", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[109, 1177], [519, 1171], [520, 1214], [109, 1220]]}, {"text": "Let's learn a few rules for comparing integers without using the number line.", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[107, 1242], [1383, 1239], [1384, 1283], [107, 1286]]}, {"text": "Everypositive integerisalwaysgreater than everynegative integer.", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[115, 1313], [1273, 1313], [1273, 1355], [115, 1355]]}, {"text": "Agreaterintegerwitha positive signis greaterthan everysmaller integerwithapositive", "conf": 0.914, "box": [[132, 1384], [1647, 1384], [1647, 1423], [132, 1423]]}, {"text": "sign.", "conf": 0.809, "box": [[153, 1451], [236, 1451], [236, 1496], [153, 1496]]}, {"text": "negative sign", "conf": 0.893, "box": [[156, 1590], [378, 1590], [378, 1634], [156, 1634]]}, {"text": "Let'sconsidertheseexamples", "conf": 0.936, "box": [[110, 1656], [595, 1661], [595, 1698], [110, 1694]]}, {"text": "Example9:", "conf": 0.872, "box": [[114, 1715], [308, 1715], [308, 1756], [114, 1756]]}, {"text": "Whichissmaller,-3or-6?", "conf": 0.878, "box": [[113, 1773], [552, 1776], [552, 1813], [113, 1810]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.856, "box": [[114, 1832], [274, 1835], [273, 1873], [114, 1870]]}, {"text": "As a greater integer with a negative sign is smaller than a smaller integer with a negative", "conf": 0.941, "box": [[110, 1882], [1629, 1906], [1629, 1959], [110, 1936]]}, {"text": "sign,so-6issmallerthan-3.", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[115, 1954], [598, 1954], [598, 1993], [115, 1993]]}, {"text": "Using number the line explain the concept of integers to the students. Help them to represent the", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[253, 2023], [1670, 2053], [1669, 2102], [252, 2072]]}, {"text": "positive integers and negative integers on the number line.", "conf": 0.896, "box": [[259, 2075], [1087, 2088], [1086, 2124], [259, 2112]]}, {"text": "30", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[825, 2220], [878, 2220], [878, 2261], [825, 2261]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.75, "box": [[1216, 2234], [1540, 2245], [1539, 2281], [1215, 2270]]}]}